1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,500
of the Book of Revelation:

3
00:00:06,501 --> 00:00:08,800
Chapter 21: "I saw a new heaven

4
00:00:08,801 --> 00:00:10,900
and a new earth, for the first heaven

5
00:00:10,901 --> 00:00:12,900
and the first earth had passed away."

6
00:00:12,901 --> 00:00:14,900
We were taught that Jesus came to establish a religion,

7
00:00:14,901 --> 00:00:17,000
but Gnostic texts say he came to free

8
00:00:17,001 --> 00:00:19,500
the soul from the system of the Demiurge.

9
00:00:19,501 --> 00:00:21,200
Jesus did not ask for worship;

10
00:00:21,201 --> 00:00:22,900
he asked for remembrance.

11
00:00:22,901 --> 00:00:24,900
In the Gospel of Thomas, it says:

12
00:00:24,901 --> 00:00:26,900
"The Kingdom is within you,

13
00:00:26,901 --> 00:00:28,500
and it is outside of you."

14
00:00:28,501 --> 00:00:30,200
He did not speak of blind faith,

15
00:00:30,201 --> 00:00:32,100
but of inner knowledge.

16
00:00:32,101 --> 00:00:33,700
That is why he was persecuted,

17
00:00:33,701 --> 00:00:35,500
because his teachings

18
00:00:35,501 --> 00:00:37,200
could not be controlled.

19
00:00:37,201 --> 00:00:39,400
Temples confined him in dogmas,

20
00:00:39,401 --> 00:00:41,500
but his message remains the same:

21
00:00:41,501 --> 00:00:43,000
Awaken,

22
00:00:43,001 --> 00:00:45,700
for you too are a child of light.

23
00:00:45,701 --> 00:00:47,700
We are living in the time of non-time.

24
00:00:47,701 --> 00:00:50,000
The dawn reveals that every instant is eternal.

25
00:00:50,001 --> 00:00:52,200
The Mayans announced a sacred cycle,

26
00:00:52,201 --> 00:00:54,900
where time dissolves and consciousness awakens.

27
00:00:54,901 --> 00:00:57,200
Today we receive the light of the stars,

28
00:00:57,201 --> 00:00:59,900
remembering that the future and the present are one.

29
00:00:59,901 --> 00:01:02,000
In Revelation 21,

30
00:01:02,001 --> 00:01:04,500
God gives us a vision of the future.

31
00:01:04,501 --> 00:01:06,500
"I saw a new heaven and a new earth."

32
00:01:06,501 --> 00:01:09,500
God will wipe away every tear from their eyes.

33
00:01:09,501 --> 00:01:11,900
What a powerful promise, right?

34
00:01:11,901 --> 00:01:13,500
One day, there will be no more pain,

35
00:01:13,501 --> 00:01:15,300
nor death, nor tears.

36
00:01:15,301 --> 00:01:17,500
Everything will be restored and made perfect

37
00:01:17,501 --> 00:01:19,300
in the presence of God.

38
00:01:19,301 --> 00:01:21,200
This reminds us

39
00:01:21,201 --> 00:01:23,200
that this world is temporary,

40
00:01:23,201 --> 00:01:25,500
and that the best is yet to come.

41
00:01:25,501 --> 00:01:27,200
If you are facing suffering,

42
00:01:27,201 --> 00:01:30,200
today you can have hope in this promise.

43
00:01:30,201 --> 00:01:32,900
Jesus invites you to be part of his eternal kingdom.

44
00:01:32,901 --> 00:01:35,500
Are you ready for that glorious day?

45
00:01:35,501 --> 00:01:37,200
May God bless you.

46
00:01:37,201 --> 00:01:38,700
For decades,

47
00:01:38,701 --> 00:01:41,200
science has tried to lock consciousness inside the skull.